  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1786661013_8017787_087b77a1983b08537d2a6addf107b176.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Invivo is The Human Microbiome Company. We create science-led supplements centred on the human microbiome and education on the connection between people, microbes and the natural world.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our hero product is<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Bio.Me™ Prebio PHGG</strong>, our bestselling soluble prebiotic fibre. PHGG stands for Partially Hydrolysed Guar Gum - fibre made from guar beans that's tasteless and textureless when mixed into food or drinks. It's also certified Low FODMAP.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Alongside PHGG, our range includes targeted supplements developed with specific microbiomes in mind.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We specialise in the microbiome rather than general wellness. Our approach brings together science, education and carefully considered supplementation, making complex microbiome topics easier for people to understand and incorporate into everyday life.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our supplements are GMP certified and Non-GMO, with science-led formulations and third-party testing. Invivo is also a<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Certified B Corporation™</strong>, reflecting our wider commitment to responsible social and environmental business practices.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn commission by referring customers to Invivo Healthcare through their unique tracked affiliate link.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We recommend leading with<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Bio.Me™ Prebio PHGG</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>as an accessible introduction to Invivo. From there, affiliates can introduce their audience to our wider microbiome-focused supplement range and educational content.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Educational, trust-led content is particularly well suited to Invivo. Helping your audience understand a topic first can create a natural route to discovering the relevant product.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Create useful, educational content that makes microbiome and \"fibremaxxing\" content feel accessible.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">PHGG content could include:</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">× What PHGG actually is <br>× Prebiotic fibre explained simply<br>× How to add PHGG to an everyday routine<br>× Demonstrating how easily PHGG dissolves into water, coffee or other drinks <strong>and</strong> food <br>× Exploring different types of dietary and prebiotic fibre<br>× Discussing its Low FODMAP certification<br>× Sharing your genuine experience of using the product<br>× Introducing your audience to Invivo's wider microbiome education and supplement range</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We encourage thoughtful, informative content over hard selling. Curiosity, education and genuine personal experience are the best fit for our brand.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>Please keep all promotion responsible and evidence-led. Affiliates must not claim that Invivo supplements diagnose, prevent, cure or treat medical conditions, or guarantee a particular health outcome. <strong>Do not</strong> <strong>use</strong> phrases or suggestions such as \"cure\", \"treat\", \"heal\", \"fix\" or \"immunity boosting\".</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Please clearly disclose your affiliate relationship and only use product information and claims provided or approved by Invivo.</p></div></div>",
